# astrologer.ai
## AI Architecture

Version 1.0

---

# Objective

The AI system should generate a premium, personalized palm reading report from a single uploaded palm image.

The report should feel:

• Personal

• Insightful

• Consistent

• High quality

• Generated within 15–20 seconds

The AI should never generate harmful, medical, legal or guaranteed future predictions.

---

