User Uploads Palm

↓

Validate Image

↓

Upload to Cloudinary

↓

Store Image URL

↓

OpenAI Vision Analysis

↓

Structured Palm Analysis (JSON)

↓

OpenAI Report Generation

↓

Generate Full Report

↓

