---

# Why Two-Step AI?

Do NOT ask the LLM to directly inspect the image and write a report.

Instead:

Step 1

Vision Model extracts structured observations.

Step 2

LLM converts observations into a premium report.

Advantages

• More consistent output

• Easier debugging

• Lower hallucinations

• Better prompt control

• Easy to swap LLM providers later

---

# AI Components

## Component 1

Vision Analysis Service

Responsibility

Read palm image.

Extract observable palm features.

Output structured JSON only.

No predictions.

No report writing.

---

## Component 2

Report Generation Service

Responsibility

Take structured palm observations.

Generate the final personalized report.

