# Report Generation Strategy

Generate the FULL report immediately after upload.

Do NOT generate anything after payment.

Advantages

• Instant unlock

• No second AI call

• Easier retries

• Lower latency

• Better UX

---

# Preview Strategy

Preview should contain approximately 20% of the report.

Blur remaining content.

CTA

Unlock Your Complete Reading

The preview must create curiosity.

---

# Image Validation

Reject if

• Multiple hands detected

• Palm not visible

• Poor lighting

• Blurry image

• Low resolution

• Fingers cropped

Return user-friendly error messages.

---

# Retry Strategy

If Vision fails

Retry once.

If Report generation fails

Retry once.

If still unsuccessful

Return

"We couldn't analyze your palm. Please try another image."

Never loop indefinitely.

---

# Timeout Rules

Vision

20 seconds

Report Generation

20 seconds

Overall request

40 seconds

After timeout

Return graceful error.

---

# AI Safety

The AI must never

• Diagnose diseases

• Predict death

• Predict accidents

• Guarantee marriage

• Guarantee wealth

• Give legal advice

• Give financial advice

Reports should be framed as reflective insights, not factual predictions.

---

# Confidence Handling

If image quality is low

Ask user to upload another image.

Never fabricate confidence.

---

# Cost Optimization

One Vision request

One LLM request

Only one report generated per upload.

No repeated AI calls after payment.

